              {
                "color": "text",
                "value": null
              }
            ]
          },
          "unit": "s"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "description": "All three are seconds, so they share one axis. If Total is high while overhead and egress are flat, the engine is slow \u2014 not the router.",
